Description: accelerated 3-axis numerical control machining simulator
 CAMotics Fast is a performance-focused fork of the CAMotics 3-axis G-code
 simulator. It retains full marching cubes as a reference and fallback while
 adding opt-in Dexel, sparse extraction, safe reduction, and faster playback.
